ent took 10.2% of revenue in FY2026 ($2.4 billion), against 10.2% in FY2021.","cites":["LRCX.rd.2026","LRCX.revenue.2026","LRCX.rd.2021","LRCX.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $966 million in FY2026, 4.2% of revenue; in FY2021 it was $349 million, 2.4%.","cites":["LRCX.capex.2026","LRCX.revenue.2026","LRCX.capex.2021","LRCX.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2026 was $4.3 billion, about 136 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 196 days, at the end of FY2024.","cites":["LRCX.inventory.2026","LRCX.cost.2026","LRCX.inventory.2024","LRCX.cost.2024"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2026 was China: $7.9 billion, 34% of revenue.","cites":["LRCX.mix.geography.2026.0","LRCX.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2026 was Systems Revenue: $14.9 billion, 64% of revenue.","cites":["LRCX.mix.product.2026.0","LRCX.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Customer 1” at 16% of revenue.","cites":["LRCX.conc.2026.0"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Customer 2” at 15% of revenue.","cites":["LRCX.conc.2026.1"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2026 report tags the customer it labels “Customer 3” at 12% of revenue.","cites":["LRCX.conc.2026.2"]}]}}